Somnant.wikitext:
{{LOVPortal}}
The '''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a title given to a [[Votann Ancestor Core]] in possession of the [[Urani-Surtr Regulates]].{{Fn|1}}

At the heart of the URSR's territory is a [[System]] containing an artificial world that has grown around a truly ancient [[Kin]] vessel dating back from the earliest periods of the [[First Ancestors]] [[Long March|migration]]. Within this vessel is a [[Votann Ancestor Core]] dubbed the [[Somnant]], which the URSR [[Grimnyr]] believe to be more ancient than any other but has slumbered, uncommunicative, for as long as the league has known. The League's other but only semilucid Ancestor Core has made pronouncements suggesting that the Somnant may be one of the [[First Ancestors]] or even the [[Votann (Ancestor)|Votann]] itself. Should the Somnant ever wake, the knowledge it possesses, uncluttered with millennia of Kin minds, could change the [[Galaxy]]. However the URSR has lost the means to awaken the Somnant, if they ever did possess it. All they can do is stand guard over it as their Grimnyr attempt to find various invocations that may succeed.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
