Sordhen.wikitext:
{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
'''Sordhen''' is a [[Baron|Baroness]] of [[House Terryn]], who commands an alliance of Knightly Nobles and [[Freeblade]]s known as the [[Padah March]].{{Fn|1a}}


==Biography==
The Baroness is known to use a coterie of soothsayers, [[hierophant]]s and readers of the [[Emperor's Tarot]] to help stage her attacks, despite having a great hatred of [[Chaos|Sorcery]].{{Fn|1a}}

When the [[Psychic Awakening]] was happening across the [[galaxy]], Sordhen and the Padah March allied themselves with [[Magos Dominus]] [[Xu Kroll]]'s [[Reclamation Fleet]], as he aided imperilled [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] worlds.{{Fn|1a}}

During the [[Battle of Ordex-Thaag]], Sordhen led the assault on the main gatehouse of Qysberg fortress. Her Knights experienced horrible losses during the battle and she became embittered when she discovered Kroll had just used them as a distraction to test the [[Varlian Device]]. Sordhen took Kroll captive, intending to take him back to [[Mars]] to stand trial before the [[High King]] of [[House Terryn]]. However, she may have had a change of heart when Kroll revealed his ability to block the [[warp]].{{Fn|1b}}

