The '''Splinter King''', or '''King of Splinters''', is a [[Slaanesh]]i [[Daemon Prince]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
His [[Chaos]] powers can torture the flesh of his enemies and also mutilate time itself. The Splinter King would use this ability to creating a contorted princedome within the [[Realm of Chaos]], which encroached upon the border of of the [[Chaos God]] [[Khorne]]'s domain. When the Blood God learned of this, he sent his [[Daemon]]ic Legions to slaughter the depraved Daemon Prince. When Khorne's Daemons entered the Splinter King's twisted domain, though, they were met by ranks upon ranks of the Daemon Prince's [[Daemonette]]s. But at the moment the battle was about to erupt, the Splinter King froze the Blood God's Daemons in time, and they became as still as statues. The Daemons were unable to slake their lust for murder and upon seeing this, Khorne bellowed in rage. His ire roused the [[Flesh Hound]] [[Karanak]] to the hunt, and the savage hound raced to burst through the magics surrounding the Splinter King's domain. Karanak then pounced on the [[Daemon Prince]] and ripped the Splinter King's essence to shreds. This freed Khorne's Daemons from their stasis and allowed them to indulge in their long-awaited slaughter upon the Daemonettes.{{Fn|1}}

