Squint.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''The Squint''' was a [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]] [[Bounty Hunter]], who worked in the [[Underhive]] of [[Hive Primus]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
After the [[Underhive]] settlement [[Sin-Sin Alley]] was destroyed by six [[Spyrer]]s, Squint tracked the armoured [[Noble]]s to their hidden hideout. Besides the Spyrers, however, was a young [[Bonnie Annerson]] who was the only survivor of Sin-Sin and was being held captive by the Nobles. The sadistic Spyrers had hoped to use her as bait to draw worthy Underhive targets to come to her rescue, in order to gather more trophies. While they had laid in wait, when Squint appeared at the hideout, he was able to calmly pick them off, one by one. When the Nobles were dead, Squint freed Annerson, but the Spyrers' had webbed up her head with steel threads had left her face permanently disfigured. She also now had no family or home to return to as well and this led the Squint to raise her himself. Annerson was left vengeful by her ordeal and the Squint would go on to teach her the art of bounty hunting. Sometime later, her mentor and guardian passed away and since the Squint's death, Annerson has matured into a driven masked Bounty Hunter.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
