Steel Fang (Wych).wikitext:
{{DrukhariPortal}}
'''Steel Fang''' is an infamous [[Dark Eldar]] [[Wych]] [[Succubus]] whose true name has been deleted from all records. She is most well known for her teachings as the undisputed queen of improvised weaponry.{{Fn|2}}

==History==
In 421.[[M41]], she was but a nameless messenger who walked unarmed into the Inner Council of [[Craftworld]] [[Lugganath]] on a diplomatic mission{{Fn|2}}, smashed apart a crystal statue of [[Khaine]] and used the shards as deadly weapons to kill the [[Autarch]] and his advisors one by one before fleeing into the [[webway]] with a holocapture of her murderous deed{{Fn|1}} and a new nickname – '''Steel Fang'''. In the [[Bleak Pit]] of [[Port Carmine]] she defeated an Elder [[Sslyth]] with nothing more than the hot sand of the pit floor.{{Fn|2}}

It is of little wonder that the [[Cult of the Steel Fang]] would grow under her leadership, and her teachings in the art of improvised weaponry spread throughout the arenas of Commorragh.{{Fn|1}} becoming a well known [[Succubus]] and the undisputed queen of the craft.{{Fn|2}}

