'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Commodore]] of the [[Imperial Navy]].{{Fn|1}}

Appointed by [[Admiral]] [[Ram Thoen]] to command a flotilla in the [[Acheros Sailent]] of the [[Jericho Reach]], it is largely due to Hemelschot's efforts that the majority of his fleet remains intact despite a series of punishing battles. He arose from humble beginnings as an Ensign when an [[Ork]] boarding attack slaughtered many officers aboard his vessel. He rallied the survivors and managed to drive the Orks off and reclaim the vessel. He has since risen through the ranks, working closely with the [[Commissariat]] to keep morale and discipline in his fleet high. At the [[Second Battle of Vanity]] in 811.[[M41]] he managed to defeat [[Stigmartus]] [[Heavy Cruiser]]s with a squadron smaller [[Dauntless Class Light Cruiser]]s with a slingshot pincer maneuver. Hemelschot was obsessed by the possibility of a [[Blackstone Fortress]] in orbit around the Chaos [[Fortress World]] of [[Magog (Planet)|Magog]]. He is also known to engage in dealings with [[Eldar Ranger]]s such as [[Syndilian Shanyr]], drawing the gaze of the [[Ordo Xenos]].{{Fn|1}}

