'''Stefanus''' was a [[Battle Brother]] of the [[Black Templars]], who served his [[Chapter]] for centuries.{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
He wielded the [[Heavy Bolter]], [[Howl of the Black Knight]] and was convinced its howl alone could could destroy [[Xenos]]. Stefanus' service to his [[Chapter]] finally ended when he died, during the [[Haynis Crusade]], but the Black Knight was not recovered by the [[Black Templars]]. The Heavy Bolter was later found by the [[Blood Ravens]], who added the weapon to their Chapter's [[Blood Ravens Armoury|arsenal]].{{Fn|1}}

