Stenius.wikitext:
{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
'''Stenius''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Dark Angels]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] active during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{fn|1a}}

Born on [[Terra]] as opposed to [[Caliban]]{{Fn|4}}, Stenius was a veteran of many of the Legion's earliest campaigns, his face was covered by the scars of battle. By the time of the [[Battle of Diamat]] early in the Heresy, he was the commanding officer of the Dark Angels' flagship ''[[Invincible Reason]]''.{{Fn|1b}} He later took a commanding role in the [[Battle of Zepath]].{{Fn|2}}

During and after the period of [[Imperium Secundus]], Stenius continued to act as the master of the ''Invincible Reason''. He commanded the vessel during the [[Battle of Pyrrhan]] and [[Second Battle of Davin]].{{Fn|3}} Shortly before the [[Siege of Terra]] Stenius was charged with destroying traitor homeworlds such as [[Chemos]] and [[Barbarus]].{{Fn|4}}

Stenius was also a senior [[Battle brother|Knight]] of the [[Hexagrammaton|Hexagrammaton’s]] [[Ironwing]], and was known to be accompanied by a pair of [[Excindio|Excindio class Battle-Automata]] whenever they were unleashed.{{Fn|5}} Additionally, Stenius would occasionally don a [[Warp|psychically]] baffled helm drawn from the [[Order of Santales]]' [[The Dreadwing Sacristy|armorium]] when the need arose to engage foes who were empowered by the warp, which would shroud his presence from them.{{Fn|5}}

