Stigand.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Stigand''' was a [[Trooper]] of the [[Jantine First|Jantine Patricians]].{{Fn|1a}}


==Biography==
At one point in the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]], the Patricians were deployed on [[Menazoid Epsilon]]. The [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment's]] commander, [[Colonel]] [[Draker Flense]], wished to avenge a stain on his honour by killing [[Colonel-Commissar]] [[Ibram Gaunt]], and so Flense broke off from the main force with a team of five Jantine Troopers (including Stigand) to track Gaunt down.{{Fn|1a}}

The Jantines descended into a network of tunnels beneath a [[Chaos]] necropolis and lured Gaunt into an ambush. However, they were unsuccessful; Gaunt defeated Flense in a duel to the death and the remaining Jantine were all killed.{{Fn|1b}}

