Stilich.wikitext:
{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
'''Stilich''' is an [[Adeptus Mechanicus]]  [[Magos]] from the [[Forge World]] [[Tolkhan]] and he fights beside its [[Titan Legion]], [[Legio Pallidus Mors]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
The [[Magos]] was among the [[Imperial]] forces that aided in defending the [[Khaldun Sector]] from the [[Craftworld]] [[Riellen]]. The [[War for the Khaldun Sector]] saw many of its worlds fall to the Craftworld and Stilich was among [[Tolkhan]]'s forces that were sent to aid in reclaiming [[Eryx]]. He was part of the [[Emperor Titan]] [[Praes Vindicta]]'s escort, but as they neared the world, their [[Pegasus Transport]], [[Arca Novem]], was shot down by Riellen's forces.{{Fn|1}} 

While Stilich and many of the [[Arca Novem]]'s passengers survived the subsequent crash landing on [[Eryx]], the [[Praes Vindicta]] was left trapped within the [[Pegasus Transport]]. This prevented the [[Emperor Titan]] from aiding in the Novem's defense, when the [[Riellen]] [[Farseer]] [[Tilwen]] led the [[Craftworld]]'s forces to destroy the transport. However Stilich, the [[Magos]] [[Aclys]] and the [[Knight]] [[Baron]] [[Jaromar]], led the Novem's defenders in fending off all of Riellen's attacks. Soon [[Imperial]] reinforcements from elsewhere on Eryx began arriving to save the besieged transport and this caused the Craftworld's forces to flee. Though the Praes Vindicta also survived the battle, it would need six months of repair work before the Emperor Titan could be deployed into the [[War for the Khaldun Sector]] again.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
''Stilich'' was created by [[Pierre Dahl]] and he appeared in [[Firepower Issue 3]].{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
