Stone (Lord Commander).wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Stone''' is an [[Astra Militarum]] [[Lord Commander]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
In [[M42]], his [[Sector Command]] included the defense of the [[Imperial]] world [[Lazulai]], when it was invaded by [[Tyranids]]. It was ultimately overrun, however, and was declared to be lost. Though no further reinforcements were to be sent, there was still an important asset on Lazulai that needed to be saved, before the Tyranids devoured the world. Stone would order [[General]] [[Kvelter]] of the [[Cadian 2012th]] [[Regiment]] to carry out this mission from her base in the '''Cobalt Fortress'''. It was one of the last fortresses left on Lazulai, and Kvelter sent out several heavily armed groups to reach the asset. Despite their might, each group was destroyed before they could come close to the asset's distant location however.{{Fn|1}}  

When an overwhelmingly force of [[Tyranids]] was later discovered to be heading towards the '''Cobalt Fortress''', though, [[Lord Commander]] Stone ordered a final attempt to be made to recover the asset. But since her heavily armed groups had been quickly destroyed, the [[General]] decided to send out a group that would not be noticed by the [[Xenos]]. [[Kvelter]] would chose [[Major]] [[Wulf Khan]] and her [[Catachan CMIII]] for the mission, as they could traverse the hellscape the Tyranids had turned [[Lazulai]] into.{{Fn|1}} 

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Deathworlder (Novel)]], Chapter 1

