{{QuoteBox
|quote = '''''"[[Captain (Imperial Guard)|Captain]], the reason we've got these tracks is to get us into trouble faster. Now I suggest you mount up and move out. The enemy is that way, don't stop 'til you find him, and don't come back 'til you've beaten him."'''<br>- Stranski.'''''{{Cite this}}
