Su'than.wikitext:
{{SalamandersPortal}}
{{Fanatic}}
'''Su'than''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] in the [[Salamanders]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He took part in the [[Third War of Armageddon]], where Su'than's forces were charged with protecting the city of [[Palonious]]. It was already defended by elements of the [[141st Armageddon Steel Legion]], due to the city containing the vital [[Averneas]] forge complex, but the [[Regiment]] had been ravaged, by constant attacks from the [[Blackskulls]] [[Ork Tribe]]. This led Su'than to be sent to Palonious, to ensure that Averneas did not fall to the [[Xenos]], after it became doubtful the outnumbered 141st could continue to protect the city.{{Fn|1}} 

The [[Salamanders]] had just arrived though, when the [[Blackskulls]] launched a full-scaled assault. As the attack wore on, a breach appeared in the city's defenses, which allowed the Tribe's [[Warboss|Boss]], [[Magzthrull]], to lead a sizeable force to pass through it. However, Su'than led a counter-attack against Magzthrull's forces and personally killed the Ork Boss in personal combat. He then took Magzthrull's skull as a trophy, which still adorns the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[power armor]] to this day. The loss of their leader was not enough to demoralize the Blackskulls though and the [[Xenos]] continued to pour into [[Palonious]] through the breach. This in turn pushed the Steel Legion and Salamanders further back into the city. Now seeing that the situation had become critical, Su'than took direct command of the [[141st Armageddon Steel Legion|141st]]. This however, required him to unfortunately kill one of the [[Regiment]]'s [[Commissar]]s, who vehemently disagreed with the Captain doing so.{{Fn|1}} 

Afterwards though, the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] was able to enact his plan of ambushing the invading [[Blackskulls]]. This required the [[141st Armageddon Steel Legion|141st]] near the breach to withdraw into the city and as they did so, the [[Ork Tribe]] quickly pursued them. The 141st then led the [[Xenos]] to a large force of the [[Regiment]]'s [[Battle Tank]]s, that Su'than and [[Major]] [[Istevus]] had gathered together. The retreating 141st reformed before the tanks and together their combined firepower destroyed the pursuing Blackskulls. Once these [[Orks]] were dealt with, the 141st were able to seal the breach and prevent any more of the Xenos from entering [[Palonious]. This allowed the Regiment and [[Salamanders]] to then hunt down and kill any Blackskulls that remained within the city. While the battle continued for sometime afterwards, the Ork Tribe were held back by the [[Imperials]] and the Blackskulls eventually retreated from Palonious. With the Tribe's immediate threat city now over, the Imperium was able to send fresh reinforcements to protect it.{{Fn|1}} 
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
''Su'than'', the [[141st Armageddon Steel Legion]] and [[Magzthrull]] were created by the [[Games Workshop]] employee ''Zak Belado''.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
