Sukerno.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Sukerno''' is the first and current [[Primaris Space Marine|Primaris]] [[Master of Sanctity]] of the [[Dark Krakens]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Like most experienced members of the [[Dark Krakens]], Sukerno once served as a [[Greyshield]] in the [[Indomitus Crusade]] before the [[Chapter]] was created.{{Fn|1b}} However, this has made his role harder than others who share the same role in pre-[[Ultima Founding]] Chapters. As Greyshields, the initial members of the Dark Krakens served with numerous [[Space Marines]] born from other [[Primarch]]s' [[Gene-seed]] and they had no Chapter traditions to draw strength from. It was important for Sukerno and [[Reclusiarch]] [[Herrahdura Zitadan]] to change this, and their solution was to embrace the hunting cultures of the Chapter's [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]], [[Naktis]]. In doing so, the Dark Krakens have forged an identity that has finally unified its disconnected [[Battle Brothers]]. Sukerno and Zitadan also knew that in time, the Greyshield members of the Chapter would be replaced by the warriors of Naktis. So to them, it would naturally follow that their Homeworld's cultures would influence the Dark Krakens.{{Fn|1}}   

