He attempts to atone for his , but is constantly mocked by other [[Enforcer (Alecto Security Force)|Enforcers]] for being the scion of a wealthy family. Noctis pays them back with his insouciant charm{{Fn|1a}} and attempts to atone for his past sins by championing the powerless of Nearsteel{{Fn|1}}. This task is made more difficult however, due to Nearsteel laying close to the [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] enclave '''Steelmound'''. The Mechanicus' holds jurisdiction over the ground Steelmound lays upon and they are separated from Nearsteel by a narrow band of area between them. Because of this, Noctis' latest homicide investigation, into the murder of a wealthy member of the district, became completed as half of the victim's cut apart body was located within the Steelmound's grounds{{Fn|1a}}. Due to the complicated situation, a joint-investigation between the Enforcers and Steelmound's Mechanicus was made, in order to satisfy both parties. This has led Noctis to be teamed with the [[Tech Priest]] [[Rho-1 Lux]]{{Fn|1}}, a situation that has made him very uncomfortable. Due to a past case that ended badly, Noctis' right arm and shoulder are [[Bionic]] and looking upon a member of the Mechanicus, reminds him that he has lost part of his humanity.{{Fn|1a}}

