T.H.R.U.G. 12.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
[[File:THRUG12Sparky.jpg|thumb|right|250px|T.H.R.U.G. 12 'Sparky' as a free Ogryn{{Fn|2}}]]
'''T.H.R.U.G. 12''', better known as '''Sparky''' or '''Smarticus''', is a [[bounty hunter|hired gun]] from [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]] and former [[slave ogryn]] who has rebelled against its programming and now aids other rebellious [[slave ogryn]]s in preserving their freedom.{{Fn|2}}

==Biography==
Unlike most servitor ogryns, T.H.R.U.G. 12 retained much of his mind when augmented for mono-task duties in [[House Van Saar]]'s [[Archetek Helix]] workshops in [[Hive Primus]]. Augmented with a voltrik harness and an arc-welder, T.H.R.U.G. worked on think-synths and storm-chambers until a power surge from a spire caused a catastrophic accident. A green lightning bolt struck T.H.R.U.G., imbuing him with the Van Saar home-engrams' knowledge and a newfound desire for freedom.{{Fn|2}}

Deemed too unpredictable, T.H.R.U.G. was sent down-hive to fight with the [[Daeyglow Dragons]] gang. His rebellious spirit grew, and with encouragement from a [[Ratling]] slopper named [[Epyff Anyi]], he overthrew the gang's leadership. This sparked an uprising, attracting other [[Ogryn]]s, [[Beastmen]], [[mutant]]s, and [[Ratling]]s to his cause. T.H.R.U.G. became a prominent rebel figure. His activities caught the attention of the Merchants Guild, which issued bounties for his capture or execution.{{Fn|2}}

