Taelos (Chaplain).wikitext:
{{CrimsonFistsPortal}}
'''Taelos''' is a [[Chaplain]] in the [[Crimson Fists]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was among its forces{{Fn|1}} that [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Ashor Drakken]] led to aid [[Badlanding]],{{Fn|2}} after the [[Imperial]] world was invaded by the [[Orks]] of [[Warboss|Warlord]] [[Snagrod]], the [[Arch-Arsonist of Charadon]]. However this ended in disaster and the Orks were victorious.{{Fn|3}} Taelos took temporary command of the Crimson Fists' forces on Badlanding afterwards and cleverly instructed his [[Techmarines]] to install a large-scale [[Vox-Caster]] on his [[power armor]]. In this way, the [[Chaplain]] was able to uplift the downtrodden Imperial forces left on Badlanding with his litanies of hate. Sometime later, Taelos was among the Crimson Fists' forces who took part{{Fn|1}} in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|4}} [[Gathrog Campaign]], against the Orks of the [[Green Kroosade]].{{Fn|5}} However the Chaplain was later killed by the [[Xenos]], in one of the Campaign's battles.{{Fn|1}} 
