'''Tallica Vare''' is a '''Sector Master''' of the [[Vindicare Temple]]'s [[Segmentum Pacificus]] command{{Fn|1a}} on [[Helax XI]].{{Fn|1c}} 
==History==
In [[M42]], a '''Liaison''' of the [[Officio Assassinorum]]'s '''Master of Operations''' came to [[Helax XI]]{{Fn|1a}}, seeking a [[Vindicare]] to lead an [[Execution Force]]. Due to it being a high-risk mission to assassinate the secessionist [[High King|High Monarch]] [[Lucien Yavarius-Khau]]{{Fn|1b}}, Vare selected [[Absolom Raithe]] who was Vindicare [[Segmentum Pacificus|Pacificus]]' most accomplished field agent at the time. He hated to do so, however, as this was to be Raithe's 50th assassination, which upon its completion would earn the Vindicare the Officio rank of '''Sicarius Primus'''. Vindicare Pacificus had not produced a Sicarius since the [[War of the Beast]] and it would have meant a great deal to them. While the Liaison said the Execution Force could succeed in their dangerous mission, Vare thought it was unlikely that Raithe would return alive to receive the Sicarius' jade laurel.{{Fn|1a}}
