Tannister.wikitext:
{{DeathwatchPortal}}
'''Tannister''' is a [[Deathwatch Captain]] of [[Watch Fortress]] [[Keep Extremis]].{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
He was present there,{{Fn|1b}} when the [[Great Rift]] was created and [[Keep Extremis]] became part of [[Imperium Nihilus]].{{Fn|1a}} The [[Watch Fortress]] was then repeatedly attacked by [[Traitor]]s{{Fn|1a}} and while Tannister{{Fn|1b}} and his [[Deathwatch]] [[Battle Brothers]] successfully drove off all of the attacks, they suffered substantial casualties in doing so. However when Keep Extremis later received distress calls from [[Vigilus]], during the [[War of Beasts]],{{Fn|1a}} the [[Watch Captain]] was sent to aid the [[Imperial]] world{{Fn|1b}} with a [[Watch Company]]. His forces were sent aboard the [[Strike Cruiser]] [[Remorseless]],{{Fn|1a}} but when they arrived there, it received distress calls from across the [[Vigilus System]]. These included the [[Death World]] [[Falsehood (World)|Falsehood]] and the [[Moon]] [[Neo-vellum]], which was sent by the [[Ordo Xenos]] [[Inquisitor]] [[Lysette Astromar]]. Tannister reacted to this new development by splitting his Watch Company into its individual [[Kill-Team]]s and sending them to answer each distress call. Amongst his forces was [[Kill Team Mordelai]], which was sent to aid the settlement of '''Vain Hope''' on Falsehood.{{Fn|1b}}

