Tarchese Malabreux.wikitext:
{{SonsOfHorusPortal}}
'''Malabreux''' was the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Sons of Horus]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s [[Catulan Reaver Squad]], during the later years of the [[Siege of Terra]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He took command after the death of their prior leaders, [[Kalus Ekaddon]] and [[DeRall]]. In the aftermath of the failed assault on the [[Saturnine Gate]], fissures began to grow between those of the [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] who fell under the sway of [[First Captain]] [[Ezekyle Abaddon]] and those who stayed true to their [[Primarch]], [[Horus]]. Malabreux was among those who not only followed Horus, but also worshiped the [[Primarch]] as if he was one of the [[Chaos Gods]].{{Fn|1}}

During the final stages of the Siege, Malabreux led an assault that captured [[Rogal Dorn]]'s own command center, the [[Bhab Bastion]]. Carrying the bloody banner of the fortress, by this point he was ignoring [[Abaddon]]'s orders.{{Fn|2}}

After the defeat of Horus, Malabreux was able to evacuate back into orbit with the ''[[Vengeful Spirit]]'' and was part of the retreat from the [[Sol System]] under [[Abaddon]]. Abaddon remarked that Malabreux seemed almost burnt out by the dark powers that had taken hold of him, and was unaware he was constantly weeping.{{Fn|3}}

