Tartorekh.wikitext:
{{NecronPortal}}
'''Tartorekh the Scourge''' is a [[Necron Overlord]] of the [[Szarekhan Dynasty]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Sometime after the [[Great Rift]] was created, he led an invasion of the [[Imperial]] [[Vatrica System]]. His forces nearly succeeded in doing so, until the [[Black Templars]] [[Purgus Crusade]] came to the [[System]]'s aid. Led by [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]] [[Holgher]], the Crusade began to push the Necrons back and rallied Vatrica's surviving Imperial military forces and civilians who wished to fight against the invaders. Tartorekh and his forces are now bogged down in a war of attrition against the Imperials for the fate of the Vatrica System.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
