'''Tarugar''' was a [[World Eaters]] [[Devourers|Devourer]] who rose to a leadership position in the [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] during the [[Great Scouring]].{{Fn|1}} Later, he became the warlord of a warband dubbed the "[[Devourers (Warband)|Devourers]]".{{Fn|2}}

==History==
Tarugar held no high rank during the [[Horus Heresy]], but after the [[Siege of Terra]] he managed to rise to one of the members of the World Eaters' "Enclave" leadership council. He took his post from the [[Space Marine Captain|captain]] of the [[11th Company (World Eaters)|11th Company]], a unit that had been completely killed on [[Terra]]. A hot-headed and highly aggressive individual, Tarugar was regarded as a supporter of ''de facto'' Legion commander [[Goghur]]; some World Eaters (such as [[Argus Brond]]) disdainfully believed that Tarugar had only risen in the ranks due to being Goghur's lackey.{{Fn|1}}

Before the [[Battle of Skalathrax]], Tarugar was one of the World Eaters officers who called for an immediate attack on the [[Emperor's Children]].{{Fn|1}} He survived the battle, but was eventually killed by [[Khârn]] inside the [[Eye of Terror]].{{Fn|2}}

