Tarvos Kyne.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Tarvos Kyne''' is a [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromundan]] [[Wyrd (Psyker)|Wyrd]] who dwells in [[Hive Primus]]' [[Underhive]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
He was once almost converted into serving the [[Chaos Gods]] by a [[Chaos Cult|Cult]], but Kyne was able to reject the Gods' influence and then destroyed the Cult. Kyne has since created the [[Midnight Realm]] in the [[Underhive]], which serves as a sanctuary for other [[Wyrd (Psyker)|Wyrd]]s on [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]. It is said that only his kind can pass through the dark sphere that Kyne has surrounded the Realm with.{{Fn|1}}

