*{{Endn|2}}: [[Catachan Devil (Novel)]], [https://www.simonandschuster.com/books/Catachan-Devil/Justin-Woolley/Warhammer-40-000/9781800261303 Simon & Schuster Description] (Last accessed on 7 January 2022)
