The Witness.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Daemon Prince]] of [[Chaos]], unusual in that he is pledged to both [[Khorne]] and [[Nurgle]].{{Fn|1c}}

==History==
Originally a [[Space Marine]] named '''Phrynon''', he was [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Viridian Consuls]]. During the [[Abyssal Crusade]] his Chapter was sent into the [[Eye of Terror]] and was destroyed or corrupted by Chaos and becoming known as [[The Broken]]. Phrynon himself was corrupted, eventually being granted the gift of [[Daemon Prince|apotheosis]] by both [[Nurgle]] and [[Khorne]] and dubbing himself '''The Witness'''.{{Fn|1a}}

The Witness eventually made his home at [[Space Hulk]] ''[[Fury (Space Hulk)|Fury]]'' and made his way towards the [[Ultramar]] in 812.[[M41]], intent on luring [[Marneus Calgar]] into a trap.{{Fn|1a}} Calgar led a boarding operation to destroy the Hulk, where the [[Ultramarines]] were beset upon by The Broken and their [[Daemon]]ic allies. In the final battle, Calgar was able to banish The Witness back to the [[Warp]] after smashing in its skull with his [[Power Fist]]s.{{Fn|1db}}

