Theodulus Pallisar.wikitext:
{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a member of the Cult [[Destructor]] of the [[Myrmidon|Myrmidonae]]. Theodulus Pallisar is a loyalist war hero of the [[Horus Heresy]]. He has the high rank of Cult-Hierophant within the destructor brotherhoods.{{Fn|1}}

==Overview==
In the midst of the [[Battle of Trisolian]] before [[Hester Aspertia Sigma-Sigma]] turned traitor and handed over control of the world to the [[Horus|Warmaster]], [[Belisarius Cawl]] fought alongside Theodulus and his myrmidon clade on [[Trisolian A-4]], in the agrifields. They saved the young [[Tech-Priest]] Cawl from the [[Night Lords]] and Cawl would repair one of Pallisar's followers.{{Fn|1}}

==Cawl's Custody==
At some point subsequently, Belisarius Cawl and his friend [[Friedisch Adum Silip Qvo]] would flee [[Septa Station]] aboard the ''[[Silencia]]'', a small stolen ship, and seek refuge from traitor forces on the loyalist world of [[Ryza]]. They attempted to notify the Adeptus Mechanicus monitor Archaeus that they were loyalist refugees from Trisolian extraction facility [[Momus]], designation [[Phi-9120]], [[Segmentum Solar]]. However the station instead sent 3 [[Basilikon Astra]] [[Navatoi]] to board the ''Silencia'' and take the lowly [[Tech-Adept]]s captive.{{Fn|1}}

Their claims of loyalty would be interrogated. Investigatory exloads of images and video from their memcore augmetics would be taken to verify their claims. Theodulus Pallisar was be contacted by the Mechanicus investigators to verify Cawl's claims and the Destructor would vouch for Cawl's loyalty and lead to the actuary-judicium releasing Cawl from custody.{{Fn|1}}

