Theron (Ultramarines).wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
{{otheruses|USE=Ultramarine|OTHERUSE=planet|OTHERPAGE=Theron (Planet)}}
'''Theron''' was a [[Space Marine]] of the [[Ultramarines]] active in the [[Indomitus Crusade]], serving in the [[8th Company (Ultramarines)|Eighth Company]] under [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Jorus Numitor|Numitor]].{{Fn|1a}}

==Biography==
A native of [[Iax]]{{Fn|1b}}, Theron was formerly a [[Battle-Brother]] of the Eighth, serving in [[Squad Pomibius|an Assault Squad]] under [[Space Marine Veteran Sergeant|Veteran Sergeant]] [[Pomibius]]. During the defence of [[Meto]] against an [[ork]] horde, Squad Pomibius was almost entirely wiped out fighting the orks, with Theron as the only survivor, barely making it back to the ''[[Mare Nostrum]]'' aboard a damaged [[Thunderhawk]] with his brothers' bodies.{{Fn|1a}}

On reaching the ''Mare Nostrum'', Theron was met by [[Chaplain]] [[Helios (Ultramarines)|Helios]]. Helios had been assigned to a new mission by Captain Numitor and Pomibius had been assigned to accompany him; obviously, with Pomibius dead this was no longer possible. Helios decided that Theron, as the squad's survivor, would be elevated to the rank of [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] and take Pomibius's place on the mission.{{Fn|1a}}

During the subsequent [[Battle of Quradim|war on Quradim]] against the [[Iron Warriors]], Theron served under Helios and was able to rendezvous with a group of surviving [[Genesis Chapter]] marines led by [[Jovian (Apothecary)|Jovian]]. As the Iron Warriors were about to overrun their central citadel, Jovian gifted Theron with the gathered [[Gene-Seed]] he had collected to ensure the Genesis Chapter had a future after their sacrifice in the battle.{{Fn|1c}} Theron was able to deliver the gene-seed to other Ultramarines, but was subsequently killed against an Iron Warriors [[Dreadnought]].{{Fn|1d}}


