'''Therrin''' is the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Rift Stalkers]] [[Chapter|Chapter's]] [[Space Marine Company|2nd Company]] and took part in the battle against the [[Thousand Sons]] flagship, ''[[Vision of Torment]]'', within the [[Spyral Nebula]].{{Fn|1}}

