Tholotep.wikitext:
{{NecronPortal}}
'''Tholotep''' is a high-ranking member of the [[Necron]] [[Szarekhan Dynasty]] and serves as an emissary for its ruler, the [[Silent King]].{{Fn|1}}

As the [[Silent King]]'s forces constructed the [[Pariah Nexus]], Tholotep had to constantly remind [[Necron Overlord|Overlord]] [[Simut]] to stay on schedule. The vainglorious Overlord would dismiss these concerns and claimed it was due to conquering populated worlds that would become nodes for the Pariah Nexus. Tholotep did not accept his excuses and during the Overlord's drawn out conquering of the [[Casparill System]], the emissary reminded Simut that he could be replaced. If he was, the Overlord would be forced to face the Silent King's wrath.{{Fn|1}}  

