Thorgrim Torson.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Thorgrim Torson''' was a member of the '''13th Company''' [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|Note 1}}

==History==
He took part{{Fn|1}} in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|2}} [[Kith Campaign]], against the invading [[Asuryani]].{{Fn|3}} Torson was also among those the [[Ordo Xenos]] gathered information on during the conflict, but it was made classified by the Ordo.{{Fn|1}} He was later killed by the [[Xenos]], during one of the Campaign's battles.{{Fn|1}}

