Thoros.wikitext:
{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
'''Thoros''' was a renowned [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Blood Angels]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], active during the [[Great Crusade]] era.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Thoros was present amongst the Blood Angels contingent during the [[Council of Nikaea]]. While there, Thoros was introduced to [[Magnus]], [[Primarch]] of the [[Thousand Sons]] by [[Sanguinius]]. He was described as one of the Blood Angels' most vaunted captains of battle.{{Fn|2}}

During the introduction, [[Ahzek Ahriman]] saw a prescient flash of Thoros' death at the hands of a [[Megarachnid]] creature during the [[War on Murder|campaign on Murder]].{{Fn|2}} When the [[Emperor's Children]] descended to the planet [[Murder]] answering a clarion call of the [[Blood Angels]], Thoros's helmet was found by [[Saul Tarvitz]] and presented as a gift of honour to [[Sanguinius]] (who arrived later).{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
