Thoul.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
[[Image:Vanguard_Sergeant_Thoul.jpg|thumb|right|250px|[[Vanguard Veteran|Vanguard]] [[Veteran Sergeant]] Thoul during the [[Orphean War]]]]
'''Thoul''' is a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] in the [[Minotaurs]] [[Chapter]] known to have served alongside the [[Inquisition]] on at least two occasions in recent years.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Thoul has served the Minotaurs for the better part of a century, and possibly much longer. He fought as a [[Sternguard Veteran]] during the [[Badab War]], with sixty-seven confirmed kills during the [[Judgement of Vyaniah]].{{Fn|2}} Nearly a century later, he led the Minotaurs detachment of [[Ordo Xenos]] [[Interdiction Force Kappa]] during the [[Orphean War]], proving to be a savage and aggressive commander. Although the Kappa was forced to withdraw, they succeeded in sabotaging several [[Necron]] structures and tomb complexes.{{Fn|3}}

After becoming captain, Thoul was given joint command of battlegroup Thoul-Rex alongside [[Inquisitor]] [[Caspiel Rex]] to aid the [[Hive World]] [[Crixos]] during an [[The Blood Purge of Crixos|invasion]] by the [[Black Legion]]. Despite being hastily dispatched to the Hive World, the battlegroup was successful in defeating the Black Legion's forces and saved the last [[hive]] still standing on Crixos' surface from being destroyed.{{Fn|1}}

==Equipment==
While leading the Minotaurs detachment in The Blood Purge of Crixos, Thoul wielded the legendary [[Burning Blade]].{{Fn|1}}

During the Orphean War, he wielded a [[Deliverance]] Pattern [[Combat Shield]], [[Mars]] Sunfury Pattern [[Plasma Pistol]], and Hesperex Pattern [[Power Axe]].{{Fn|3}}

