Thrass.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''Thrass''' was an [[Imperial Fists]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]], who took part in the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1a}} 
==History==
He was among the [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s forces that took part in the [[Night Crusade]] into the [[Occluda Noctis]], where Thrass commanded the [[Battleship]] [[Torch of Sol]]{{Fn|1a}}. At that time, he had recently received his [[Space Marine Captain|Captaincy]] and had been personally selected by his [[Primarch]] [[Dorn]], to command one of the [[Imperial Fists]]' flotillas. These small formations of Legion and [[Imperialis Armada]] warships were charged with acting as a vanguard for the Imperial Fists and would guide the main fleet to anything of interest they discovered{{Fn|1c}}. Thrass would be carrying out his duties, when his flotilla entered a [[Human]] occupied [[System]]. With information provided by the [[Carrefiefdom]] empire, which had recently been brought into [[Compliance]], the Captain was sure the System was ruled by another Human empire, known as the [[Damareen Consensus]].{{Fn|1a}} 

Thrass was the first to encounter them and broadcasted an offer for the [[Damareen Consensus|Damareen]] to join the [[Imperium]]. This offer was rejected, however, when the empire's warships attacked his flotilla. As per the [[Imperial Fists]]' standing orders for hostile first contact with the [[Occluda Noctis]]'s Human civilizations, the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] gave the order to retreat. However several of Thrass' warships were lost to the Damareen, before the flotilla returned to the [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s main fleet. The Captain would soon bring word of the Damareen's attack to his [[Primarch]]{{Fn|1b}} and [[Dorn]] led the [[Imperial Fists]] in [[Compliance|conquering]] the Damareen.{{Fn|1c}} 

==Sources==
*1: [[Rogal Dorn: The Emperor's Crusader (Novel)]]
**{{Endn|1a}}: Section 11
**{{Endn|1b}}: Section 13
**{{Endn|1d}}: Section 18    

