Threnica Eskh.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Threnica Eskh''' is a [[Knight-Centura]] of the [[Sisters of Silence]], who commands the [[Mercurian Vigil]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
They have been charged with killing a witch-lord within the [[Gulfs of Edhali]], who the [[Oracle of High Asiatica]] prophesied would rise to become a threat to the [[Emperor]]. The [[Mercurian Vigil|Vigil]] is traveling aboard the warship [[Nemesis (Warship)|Nemesis]] for the mission and are being aided by the [[Adeptus Custodes]] [[Shield Company]] of [[Shield-Captain]] [[Dmytrosian]]. Their journey has been fraught with danger and they have had to [[Voyage of the Nemesis|fight several battles]] along the way, as they race towards their target. This included the [[Battle of Topaz Heights]], where Eskh slew the dreaded [[Mind-Thief]].{{Fn|1}}

