He is both the youngest and newest member of his Kill-Team and knows he has the fewest accomplishments among them. Because of this, Tiberius believes he has a lot to prove to them, but sometimes his need to earn honour and glory can make him become rash and unreliable. Currently his Kill-Team had just destroyed a minor [[Ur-Ghul]] infestation on the mining moon [[Sidra]], when an [[Ork]] [[Kroozer]] crashed near their location. Afterwards, Agathon told his Kill-Team they would need to send a warning to Xyston about the Kroozer's appearance on the moon.{{Fn|1}}

