Tiberius Angellus Anteus.wikitext:
{{EmperorsChildrenPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a commander of the [[Emperor's Children]] during the [[Great Crusade]], [[Horus Heresy]] and [[Legion Wars]].{{Fn|1}}

Anteus was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] in the [[Emperor's Children]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] who took part in the campaign against the [[Diasporex]]{{Fn|2}} and in the [[War on Murder]]{{Fn|3}} during the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|2}}

During the Legion Wars in the [[Eye of Terror]] on [[Skalathrax]], Anteus had risen to the rank of '''Lord Emissary''' of the [[III Legion]]. There, alongside a [[Daemon]] called the "[[Hedonarch]]", Anteus parlayed with the [[World Eaters]] under [[Khârn]]. Though tense, the talks initially appeared to proceed fruitfully, with the III Legion delegation expressing thanks for the safe return one of their own, [[Palatine Blade]] [[Egil Galerius]] (who had been saved by the World Eaters on [[Terra]]). When Anteus reaffirmed that the system belonged to the Emperor's Children, however, Khârn provoked unrest and inspired World Eaters Captain [[Dreagher]] to open fire with his [[Bolt Pistol]] and kill Anteus.{{Fn|1}}

