Tiberius Helmawr.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Tiberius Helmawr''' (588.[[M41]] - 693.[[M41]]) was the [[Imperial Commander|132nd Lord]] of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
Tiberius took the throne following the reign of his father, [[Marius Helmawr]]. This occurred after Marius was murdered in his bed by the [[Underhive]] gang leader [[Dogbit Karg]] in '''646.[[M41]]'''.{{Fn|2}}

The mystery of how someone from the [[underhive]] was able to enter [[Marius Helmawr|Marius]]' inner sanctum within [[Hive Primus]]' [[Hive Spire|spire]] remains unknown to this day. Though [[House Delaque]] was later rumoured to be somehow tied into his father's death, Tiberius did not look into the matter after becoming [[Imperial Commander]]. In fact, House Delaque would go on to win a number of the [[Imperial House]]'s contracts during the first years of Tiberius's reign.{{Fn|2}} He was later succeeded by [[Caetrus Helmawr]].{{Fn|1}}

