Tibrum.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Tibrum''' was an [[Imperial]] [[Commissar]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
While still a cadet of the [[Schola Progenium]], Tibrum was selected to become a Commissar. He was given a test by one of the Schola's [[Preacher]]s - the traditional test of any cadet chosen for that particular path: he was to find his best friend of ten years, [[Drusus (Progena)|Drusus]], and shoot him with a [[laspistol]]. Tibrum accepted the order without hesitation.{{Fn|1}}

Later, after his graduation, Tibrum was assigned to the [[PDF]] of an Imperial [[Death World]]. His duty was to whip the PDF [[trooper]]s under his command into shape, in order to defend their world from [[Necron]]s that had been awakened by mining operations.{{Fn|1}}

