Tigraine.wikitext:
{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
{{Spoiler|source=Warhammer 40,000: Freeblade}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Dark Angels]] [[Space Marine Captain|Master]] who was dispatched by his [[Chapter]] with a strike force aboard the [[Strike Cruiser]] ''[[Fist of Caliban]]''{{Fn|1a}} to stop the [[Waaagh!]] of the [[Warboss]] [[Nekkruncha]] which was soon going to invade the [[Imperium]] world [[Tarnis]].{{Fn|1b}}

The Dark Angels knew the world well, as it was home to the [[Imperial Knights]] of [[House Drakkus]], who had a pact of alliance with the Chapter. As the ''Fist of Caliban'' neared Tarnis, however, {{PAGENAME}} received a plea for aid from House Drakkus, as the Knights' fortress was under attack from a large [[Khorne]] Warband. When they reached Tarnis, {{PAGENAME}} quickly ordered his forces to aid the Household, but when they arrived at '''Fort Drakkus''', the Khorne Warband had already overwhelmed the Knights; though the Dark Angels were able to push the Warband back, and evacuate a single Knight and a few other survivors to the ''Fist of Caliban''.{{Fn|1a}} Once they were back aboard the Strike Cruiser, {{PAGENAME}} began his defense of Tarnis against both Warboss Nekkruncha{{Fn|1b}} and the Khorne Warband.{{Fn|1c}} He also designated [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Midael (Sergeant)|Midael]] to act as an envoy to House Drakkus' remaining Knight, who vowed to uphold the pact his Household had made with the Dark Angels. Taking the mantle of the [[Freeblade]] [[Vortigan]], he soon began aiding {{PAGENAME}} and the Dark Angels in saving his now beleaguered Home World.{{Fn|1a}}

