Tilwen.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Tilwen''' is a [[Farseer]] of the [[Asuryani]] [[Craftworld]] [[Riellen]] and was among its forces that took part in the [[War for the Khaldun Sector]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
During the [[War for the Khaldun Sector|War]], he aided in defending the conquered world [[Eryx]], as the [[Imperium]] sought to reclaim it from the [[Craftworld]]. As the battle for the world waged, though, the [[Legio Pallidus Mors]] [[Pegasus Transport]] [[Arca Novem]], was shot down by [[Riellen]]'s forces and it crash landed on the world. Tilwen knew the transport contained the Legio's [[Emperor Titan]] [[Praes Vindicta]] and the [[Farseer]] led the Craftworld's forces to destroy the Novem. If they succeeded in doing so, the loss of the Vindicta would deliver a grievous blow to the Imperium. As Riellen's attack on the transport began, however, the commanders of the Imperial forces fighting on Eryx, made frantic preparations to save the Novem from being destroyed. Also, while Tilwen sent constant suicide attacks against the transport, the Novem's passengers that survived the crash were able to fend off the Craftworld. Eventually the Imperial forces sent to save the transport began closing in on the Novem and this caused Riellen's forces to escape from the coming threat.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
''Tilwen'' and the [[Craftworld]] [[Riellen]], were created by [[Pierre Dahl]] and they appeared in [[Firepower Issue 3]].{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Firepower Issue 3]], pgs. 69-72 - ''Crash and Burn'' 

