Tiresias.wikitext:
{{ScythesOfTheEmperorPortal}}
{{otheruses|USE=Scythes of the Emperor Space Marine|OTHERUSE=Star Phantoms Space Marine|OTHERPAGE=Omadon Tiresias}}
Sergeant '''Tiresias''' was the leader of the [[Scythes of the Emperor]] [[Chapter|Chapter's]] [[21st Salvation Team]], shortly after the fall of [[Sotha]].  Before this he was a member of [[Sergeant (Space Marines)|Sergeant]] [[Marek Angeloi|Angeloi's]] squad in the [[4th Company (Scythes of the Emperor)|Fourth Company]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

Sothan by birth, he was present when the planet was attacked by [[Hive Fleet Kraken]] but was badly wounded and evacuated by [[Thunderhawk]].  After the battle at [[Giant's Coffin]] he was devastated by the loss of the majority of his [[Chapter]] but remained critical of the new [[Chapter Master]] [[Thrasius|Thrasius's]] decision to assemble [[Salvation Team]]s.{{Fn|2}}

His team rescued [[Commander]] [[Cassios]] who had remained alive in suspended animation for years aboard a [[Tyranid]] [[Hive Ship]], before being wiped out in a follow-up mission.  Severely wounded, Tiresias used a [[Reductor]] to extract both Cassios's and his own [[gene-seed]] before losing consciousness.{{Fn|2}}

Tiresias's body was recovered by [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Quintos]] and the [[121st Salvation Team]].{{Fn|2}}

He carried a [[Power Weapon|powered falx blade]] and [[bolt pistol]] during his salvation missions, but also had experience with a [[heavy bolter]].{{Fn|2}}

