The '''Titanfeller''' is a [[Knight Valiant]] [[Freeblade]] of the [[Forgotten Company]] who took part in the [[Charadon Campaign]]. It would aid the Company's efforts in defending the [[asteroid]] [[Fortress World|fortress]] of [[Ferrovigilum]] in the [[Metalica System]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
There the [[Forgotten Company]] clashed with the [[Traitor Titan]]s of the [[Legio Morbidus]] and won several remarkable battles against the giant war machines. One such victory was the '''Battle of Titandoom Canyon''', which began when the [[Freeblades]] [[Fury (Freeblade)|Fury]], [[Shortsword]] and [[Firespike]] were charged with luring a Morbidus [[Titan Maniple|Maniple]] into '''Industrial Canyon 87-ZLξ'''. After the last Warhound entered the Canyon, the Forgotten Company attacked and the [[Knight Castellan]] [[Foebreaker]] began a constant barrage of fire against the first Warhound in the Canyon. This weakened its [[Void Shield]] and allowed the Titanfeller to burst the Warhound's shield, before firing a [[Thundercoil Harpoon]] through its knee joint. This caused the Warhound to soon crash to the ground, where it was destroyed by the Forgotten Company. The two other trapped Warhounds fell to their guns quickly afterwards.{{Fn|1}} 

