'''Tjaef''' was a [[Necron Overlord]] of the [[Omtekh Dynasty]], who was among the forces sent to secure [[Blackstone]] on [[Kloravael]].{{Fn|1}} 

However the world had been claimed by the [[Bladed Cog]] [[Genestealer Cult]] and, with aid of several [[Hive Fleet Kronos]] [[Tyranids]], they sought to stop the [[Necron Dynasty|Dynasty]] from doing so. As his forces neared the mining facility where the Blackstone was, Tjaef could see there were few of the Tyranids in sight. As Tjaef had become an Overlord through not only brute force, but also a fair degree of cunning, he knew his foes were in hiding. They were waiting for Tjaef to make the first move and he willing advanced so they could so them themselves. However in the battle that followed, Tjaef was killed when he was ambushed and taken apart by Bladed Cog [[Acolyte Hybrid]]s wielding [[Rock Saw]]s. After his death, the [[Lokhust Lord]] [[Mannok Pha]] took command of the [[Omtekh Dynasty]]'s remaining forces, but they were all destroyed as well.{{Fn|1}}

