Tlewn Milloom.wikitext:
'''Tlewn Milloom''' was a heavy cargo transport driver who lived and worked on the planet [[Caligula (Hive World)|Caligula]] alongside a co-driver named [[Palapr Tuvant]].{{Fn|1}}

When the forces of the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]] came to liberate Caligula, Milloom's transport was part of a convoy led by [[Trooper]] [[Bragg]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]] ferrying relief supplies from [[Aurelian Hive]] to [[Hive Calphernia]]. However, [[Vox-Operator|Comms-Officer]] [[Raglon]] had alerted Bragg that one of the convoy's crew was in collusion with local bandits who were trying to steal the supplies. When Milloom was revealed as the collaborator, he tried to kill Bragg, but the Trooper knocked him unconscious and had him arrested.{{Fn|1}}

