'''Brother Tobias''' was a member of [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Remas|Remas's]] squad in the [[Scythes of the Emperor]] [[Space Marine]] [[Chapter]], shortly before the fall of [[Sotha]].{{Fn|1}}

The squad tried to apprehend the first [[Hive Ship]] which approached [[Sotha]], prior to the planet's destruction by [[Hive Fleet]] [[Kraken]].{{Fn|1}}

