'''Tobias Maxilla''' was a [[Rogue Trader]] of the [[Imperium]] and a close associate of [[Inquisitor]] [[Gregor Eisenhorn]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Raised by the [[Rogue Trader]] [[Vaden Awl]] and known for his extravagant dressing style, Maxilla was hired by [[Inquisitor]] [[Gregor Eisenhorn]] to help him pursue the [[Rogue Psyker]] [[Murdin Eyclone]]. During their battles Maxilla and Eisenhorn grew close, but Maxilla was injured as his ship the ''[[Essene]]'' was subjected to a failed assassination attempt on Eisenhorn. His injuries revealed much of his lower body to be mechanical in nature. During the battle on the ''Essene'' against the [[Radical]] [[Inquisitor]]s [[Heldane]] and [[Leonid Osma]], who sought the [[Daemonhost]] [[Cherubael]] from Eisenhorn, Maxilla was grievously injured but with his last strength shot Osma with his pistol, saving Eisenhorn's life as he died.{{Fn|1}}

