Tolos (Knight).wikitext:
[[Image:Tolos.jpg|thumb|right|300px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Tolos''' is a renowned [[Knight]] of [[House Raven]].{{Fn|1}}

Serving the legendary hero of House Raven, [[Krewald]], he pilots the [[Knight Warglaive]] ''Triumphal''. Once, he held a far greater prestige as a Noble bonded to a larger Knight, fighting alongside Krewald as a peer when they supported the [[Legio Metalica]] [[Titan Legion]]. However while Krewald won greater fame, Tolos went on to suffer a great dishonour that none in the House speak of. Whatever it was, he was stripped of his rank and reduced to a Bondsman. Though Tolos is somewhat grudging in his service to Krewald, his diminished status has forced him to continue to fight for his new liege.{{Fn|1}}

