Tomaz Maghernus.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Tomaz Maghernus''' was the '''Dockmaster''' of the '''Helsreach Dockers' Union''' during the [[Third War for Armageddon]].{{Fn|1a}}

During [[Helsreach Crusade|the campaign]] to defend [[Hive Helsreach]] against the invading [[ork]]s, Maghernus played a surprisingly significant role in the defence when the hive found itself subjected to [[Ork Submersible|a secondary attack]] from the sea. Since the bulk of the [[Armageddon Steel Legion]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiments]] were tied up defending Helsreach proper and unable to support the docks in time, Maghernus suggested arming a number of docker gangs as an emergency militia.{{Fn|1b}}{{Fn|1c}}

In the subsequent fighting, Maghernus fought under [[Andrej Valatok|Andrej]], one of the [[Steel Legion Storm Trooper]]s assigned to supervise the militia army.{{Fn|1c}} At some point during the next phases of the siege of Helsreach, Maghernus and his unit were separated from the other Imperial defenders. After encountering [[Asavan Tortellius]], the militia fighters made their way to one of the last Imperial rally points in Helsreach, the [[Temple of the Emperor Ascendant]].{{Fn|1d}}{{Fn|1e}} Maghernus was killed in the final defence of the Temple against the orks.{{Fn|1e}}

