'''Torustan Hin-Brahey''' is an [[Imperial]] [[Count-Commander]], who is the commander of the [[Illuminated Right Task Force]] [[Torchbearer Fleet]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
As the [[Indomitus Crusade]] raged, the Fleet came under attack by [[Tyranids]]. While most of the [[Illuminated Right Task Force|Task Force]] was able to escape, the [[Bedenite Fusiliers]] were unable to do so. The [[Regiment]]'s weeping [[Colonel]] would ask Hin-Brahey to aid them, but he refused. The Commander claimed that if the [[Emperor]] decrees the Fusiliers died in battle with the [[Xenos]], then that was the Regiment's duty. His was to ensure the Task Force reached the [[Space Marine Chapter]] they were charged with [[Primaris Space Marine|resupplying]]. The Commander then ordered his warship's [[Astropath]] to be sealed off from the bridge, so the Colonel's weeping would not distract Hin-Brahey's flag officers.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[White Dwarf 466]], pg. 55 - ''A Light in the Darkness''
