Trincus Abconcis.wikitext:
{{ImperialNavyPortal}}
'''Trincus Abconcis''' (also spelled '''Abcondis'''{{Fn|2a}}) was the [[Fleetmaster]] of [[Indomitus Crusade Fleet Quartus]].{{Fn|1}}

A grizzled [[Admiral]] who had fought against [[Tyranid]]s at the [[Battle of the Orenghuld Reach]], he was hand-picked by [[Roboute Guilliman]] to lead fleet Quartus. During the [[Indomitus Crusade]], Abcondis was informed by [[Inquisitor]] [[Glori Emagna]] of the [[Choral Engine]], which he used to score a great many victories. However after being questioned by [[Grey Knights]] [[Brother-Captain]] [[Drystann Cromm]], Abconcis began to harbor doubts and fears of [[Heresy]] over his association with the device.{{Fn|2a}}

During the subsequent [[Battle of Malak]], Abcondis displayed great bravery and skill but was ultimately overwhelmed by the [[Chaos]] host under [[Angron]] himself. The Fleetmaster met his end when [[Kharn the Betrayer]] led a boarding party aboard his own flagship, ''[[Honour of Terra (Warship)|Honour of Terra]]''.{{Fn|2b}}

