Tristan Dare.wikitext:
{{Fanatic}}{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
'''Tristan Dare''' was the last [[Grand Master]] of the [[Angels of Wrath]] [[Chapter]]{{Fn|1b}}. During the [[Age of Apostasy]] [[Goge Vandire]] demanded that the Angels of Wrath replace their [[Chaplains]], with [[Ecclesiarchy]] missionaries; in order to bring the Chapter under his control. Tristan refused and in doing so brought retribution from the Church upon his Chapter.{{Fn|1a}}

Goge soon ordered a large warfleet to attack the Angels of Wrath's [[Homeworld]] and destroy the Chapter. What came next was a complete decimation of the Chapter, as waves of zealots, of the [[Frateris Templars]], attacked in overwhelming numbers. Tristan was killed in the fighting, along with ninety percent of the Chapter, leaving his old friend [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Cornelius Makallan]] in command. Makallan soon commanded the remnants of the Chapter to evacuate their Homeworld and flee Goge's wrath{{Fn|1a}}. Though he now commanded what was left of the Chapter, Makallan refused the title of Grand Master, instead taking the title [[Chapter Master|Commander]], out of respect for Tristan.{{Fn|1b}}

==Source==
