'''Turakhin of Magadha''' (simply known as '''Turakhin''') is a [[Necron Overlord]], regent of the [[Magadha dynasty]], who resided over the [[Tomb World]] of [[Borsis]].{{Fn|1}}

==Overview==
Turakhin enjoyed a life of a material pleasures, feasting with the Necron delegates from across the sector to the music of his troubadour-minstrels, displays of techno-magick, foods and drinks provided on ornate crystal dinnerware.{{CME}}

He survived three coup attempts, but fell victim to the fourth, becoming captured within a [[tesseract labyrinth]].{{CME}}

==Personality==
Atypically for an overlord, Turakhin was known for his lavish banquets, while being a poor military commander.{{CME}}

