Twenish.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Twenish''' was a [[Verghast]]ite [[Imperial Guard Sniper|sniper]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
Prior to joining the Tanith First, Twenish was a member of the [[Vervun Primary]], the [[PDF|standing army]] of [[Vervunhive]]. Since he already had experience as a sniper in the Primary, Twenish was one of the first of the new Verghastite recruits drawn into the [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]] following the [[Siege of Vervunhive]] to join one of the regiment's specialised cadres - in his case, the sniper corps. He was noted as a good shot by the [[Tanith]] sniper [[Hlaine Larkin|Larkin]], if a tad obsessive and by-the-book.{{Fn|1}}

Twenish saw his first action with the Tanith First in the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade|Sabbat Crusade's]] [[Hagia]]n campaign. However, he was shot in the head and killed by an [[Infardi]] [[Chaos Cultist|cultist]] in the [[Battle of Bhavnager]] while trying to support a flanking manoeuvre.{{Fn|1}}

