Tybalt, like many of the Knights of House Terryn, shares his name with a character from a play by [[Wikipedia:William Shakespeare|William Shakespeare]]; in this case, [[Wikipedia:Tybalt|a character]] from ''[[Wikipedia:Romeo and Juliet|Romeo and Juliet]]''.

